# Dependabot — @agentstack/sdk (consumer sample)

Copy to `.github/dependabot.yml` in a project using `agentstack-app` profile.

```yaml
version: 2
updates:
  - package-ecosystem: npm
    directory: "/"
    schedule:
      interval: weekly
    allow:
      - dependency-name: "@agentstack/sdk"
    labels:
      - dependencies
      - agentstack-sdk

  - package-ecosystem: npm
    directory: "/examples/agentstack"
    schedule:
      interval: weekly
    allow:
      - dependency-name: "@agentstack/sdk"
    labels:
      - dependencies
      - agentstack-recipes
```

Gene: `repo.platform.sdk.onboarding.gen1`
